 "remarks": "ALL OFFERS AND FINAL AND BEST TO BE SUBMITTED BY SATURDAY, JUNE 13TH AT 3 PM. Move right into this beautifully updated and well kept condominium, offering the perfect blend of modern style, convenience, and value. Renovated within the last five years, this exceptional home features an updated kitchen with sleek quartz countertops, stainless steel appliances, and contemporary finishes. The open-concept living and dining area provides a bright and inviting space for both everyday living and entertaining. A convenient powder room is located on the main level, while two updated full bathrooms add comfort and functionality on the second level. Enjoy the convenience of on-site parking and a prime location just minutes from the Springdale Train Station, shopping, restaurants, and Merritt Parkway, making commuting a breeze. Very low HOA's are an additional perk, making this an exceptional opportunity for homeowners and investors alike seeking affordable, low-maintenance living in a desirable Stamford location. You have found your home sweet home!",
